{"unit_id":"donyue7__dsh-session-bus#card-zh","repo":"donyue7/dsh-session-bus","commit":"6859b33b225a174eb6dfe89c93347757f910054d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-bus 是一款面向 DSH 的会话协作插件，在 Host 中注册工具，让同一工作区或跨工作区的会话互相发送消息并唤醒对方。它支持按会话标题、目录或内容寻找目标，排队、即时插入或静默投递消息，也能创建新会话。配套功能包括线程跟踪、角色与任务账本、人工决策问题记录，以及共享目录写入路径的租约。适合需要把工作分派给多个 DSH 会话并收集结果的团队。运行需要 DSH Host 的会话与工具服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26","lib/index.js:40","lib/tools.js:62","lib/tools.js:135","lib/bus.js:1428","lib/bus.js:2260"]}
{"unit_id":"donyue7__dsh-session-bus#card-en","repo":"donyue7/dsh-session-bus","commit":"6859b33b225a174eb6dfe89c93347757f910054d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-bus adds DSH tools for messaging across workspaces. It finds sessions, delivers or queues messages, creates workers, and tracks threads, roles, tasks, user questions, and write leases. For teams coordinating multiple sessions; requires DSH Host session and tools services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26","lib/index.js:40","lib/tools.js:62","lib/tools.js:135","lib/bus.js:1428","lib/bus.js:2260"]}
